      "ImageDescription": {
        "value": "A dual breed (beef and milk) cow near <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oeschinen_Lake\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Oeschinen Lake\">Oeschinen Lake</a>, <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Switzerland\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Switzerland\">Switzerland</a> at an altitude of 1575 m. The breed is most likely Swiss <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fleckvieh_cattle\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Fleckvieh cattle\">Fleckvieh</a>, alternatively <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simmentaler_cattle\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Simmentaler cattle\">Simmentaler-Fleckvieh</a> or another dual breed, cf. <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Reference_desk/Archives/Science/2009_July_25#Which_cow_breed_is_this_Swiss_cow?\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Wikipedia:Reference desk/Archives/Science/2009 July 25\">this enquiry at the Wikipedia help desk</a>.",
